 - 2026-06-12: Operational retrospective for milestone 2026.06.378 — the authoritative milestone-scoped timing detector again reported a FALSE-ZERO (0 experiment commits / 0 wall-minutes / 0 compute-bound tasks), the recurring detector gap documented across .363–.377 (.376 absent), now extending to .378. Both RTX 3090s idle at the snapshot is CORRECT (the detector feed contained 0 compute-bound tasks; gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null) — not a bottleneck, and DualGPURunner is inapplicable with no model loaded. On-disk ops/changelog.md confirms .378 actually ran exp4086–exp4097: the precision-rescue de-risk SUCCEEDED (exp4087: stacked model-free certification filters raised demo-perfect→test-gold to best 0.8824 at recall 0.7143, clearing the 0.85@recall≥0.20 gate), the off-ARC analog transferred (exp4093: code demo-fit precision 0.96), the 10th ARC game first-solved (exp4092: r11l at action 4), but Phase B produced no clean verifier-label A-vs-B (exp4088 blocked_lora_smoke_checkpoints; A-vs-B pending/absent per exp4097); 1 flagged-skipped. The recurring failure is observability, not execution; highest-leverage fix remains root-causing the timing detector (or sourcing the retro window from the committed changelog) so capstone/aggregation milestones stop looking empty. results/operational_retro_2026_06_378.json
 - 2026-06-12: Archive .378 -> activate .379; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load and the python/carnot/agentic + nano-trm modules import; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the .378 close-state truth (verifier-as-reward LLM-LoRA path RETIRED on blocked_lora_smoke_checkpoints; precision-rescue succeeded on PROGRAMS but carried by demo-perfect alone; off-ARC demo-fit transfer outcome; Nth ARC game count). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v378_v379_active_lora_verifier_as_reward_retired_precision_gate_passed_on_demo_perfect_alone_ensemble_added_no_value_tenth_game_solved_games10_1_flagged_skipped_kv260_terminal_pretest_green; results/experiment_4098_archive_v378_activate_v379.json
 - 2026-06-12: TRM-POOL VERIFIER-DISCRIMINATION PROBE (THE HEADLINE; THE GATE for TRM-RFT; OFFLINE, ZERO-GPU, fabrication-immune). Apply the .378 precision-rescue primitives (augmentation-invariance, k-of-n independent-induction agreement, graded min-Hamming, demo-fit consistency) as RERANKERS on the cached TRM pass@K pool. Does ANY verifier beat TRM-vote at selecting from the pool, capturing part of the ~13pp present-but-misvoted gap (oracle 0.61 vs vote 0.48)? This decides whether RFT-ing the TRM with the verifier can possibly help. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: no_verifier_beats_trm_vote_best_K_OF_N_AGREEMENT_captured_0.0000_ci95_0.0000_0.0000_n62_underpowered_true; results/experiment_4099_trm_pool_verifier_discrimination_probe.json
